===Etymology===
From {{prefix|neuro|asthenia|lang=en}}, after {{etyl|it|en}} {{m|it|nevrastenia}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/njʊəɹəsˈθiːnɪə/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|psychiatry}} An ill-defined medical condition characterized by [[lassitude]], [[fatigue]], [[headache]], and [[irritability]], associated chiefly with emotional disturbance.

